<p>Hi<%= @user.profile&.display_name.present? ? " #{@user.profile.display_name}" : "" %>,</p>

<p>
  A Rally support admin opened your account on
  <strong><%= @started_at.strftime("%d %B %Y at %H:%M UTC") %></strong>.
</p>

<p>The reason they gave was:</p>

<blockquote style="margin: 0 0 1em; padding: 0.75em 1em; border-left: 3px solid #ddd;">
  <%= @reason %>
</blockquote>

<p>What this does and doesn't allow:</p>

<ul>
  <li>They can see your account exactly as you see it, for up to 30 minutes.</li>
  <li>They cannot change anything. The session is read-only.</li>
  <li>They cannot see your payment credentials.</li>
  <li>They cannot sign in as you again without this email being sent again.</li>
</ul>

<p>
  If this doesn't look right, reply to this email or
  <a href="<%= @support_url %>">open the chat in Rally</a> and tell us.
</p>

<p>— The Rally team</p>
